  "findings": [
    "The pinned Miles image has legacy deep_ep.Buffer but no ElasticBuffer export.",
    "CollectiveX normal DeepEP V2 requires ElasticBuffer; its upstream setup installs Torch2.10.0 and force-overrides NCCL to2.30.4. That setup has not been run and must not mutate the pinned training stack.",
    "The upstream workload hidden size7168 is DeepSeek-oriented; retain it as a standardized control and separately label any prospectively configured Qwen hidden2048 profile."
